Place an Arabic OpenType/TrueType font here (e.g. Amiri or Scheherazade New,
both SIL Open Font License). The font's internal family name must match
`subtitles.font_name` in your config.json (default: "Amiri").

Download:
  - Amiri:              https://github.com/alif-type/amiri/releases
  - Scheherazade New:   https://software.sil.org/scheherazade/

Font binaries are gitignored by default (licenses vary) — commit yours only if
its license permits redistribution.
